#: res/crawlomatic-rules-list.php:2085
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Set the custom fields that will be set for generated posts. The syntax for "
"this field is the following: custom_field_name1 => custom_field_value1, "
"custom_field_name2 => custom_field_value2, ... . In custom_field_valueX, you "
"can use shortcodes, same like in post content. You can also assign the data "
"to array custom fields, using this format: array_field[index_name1] => "
"custom_field_value1, array_field[index_name2] => custom_field_value2. "
"Example (without quotes): 'title_custom_field => %%item_title%%'. You can "
"use the following shortcodes: %%custom_html%%, %%custom_html2%%, "
"%%random_sentence%%, %%random_sentence2%%, %%item_title%%, "
"%%item_original_price%%, %%item_price%%, %%item_content%%, "
"%%royalty_free_image_attribution%%, %%item_url%%, %%item_cat%%, "
"%%current_date%%, %%current_time%%, %%item_tags%%, "
"%%item_content_plain_text%%, %%item_screenshot_url%%, "
"%%item_show_screenshot%%, %%item_read_more_button%%, %%item_show_image%%, "
"%%item_image_URL%%, %%item_description%%, %%item_gallery%%, "
"%%item_pub_date%%, %%downloaded_file%%.  You will also be able to use the "
"custom shortcodes defined in the 'Custom Shortcode Creator' feature from "
"below. You can also set a list of required words for the terms to be set. "
"UPDATE: You can set them in the following format: custom_field_name => "
"custom_field_value_if_keywords_found => required_word1, required_word2, "
"required_word3 (optional) => custom_field_value_if_keywords_not_found "
"(optional)"
msgstr ""
"Задайте пользовательские поля, которые будут заданы для сгенерированных "
"постов. Синтаксис для этого поля следующий: custom_field_name1 => "
"custom_field_value1, custom_field_name2 => custom_field_value2, ... . В "
"custom_field_valueX вы можете использовать короткие коды, такие же, как в "
"содержимом публикации. Вы также можете присвоить данные пользовательским "
"полям массива, используя этот формат: array_field[имя_индекса 1] => "
"пользовательское полно_значение1, array_field[имя_индекса 2] => "
"пользовательское полно_значение2. Пример (без кавычек): 'title_custom_field "
