"следующие короткие коды: %%custom_html%%, %%custom_html2%%, "
"%%random_sentence%%, %%random_sentence2%%, %%item_title%%, "
"%%item_description%%, %%item_gallery%%, %%item_content%%, "
"%%item_content_plain_text%%, %%item_screenshot_url%%, %% "
"item_show_screenshot%%, %%item_img_url%%, %%royalty_free_image_attribution%%,"
" %%item_url%%, %%item_cat%%, %%current_date%%, %%current_time%%, "
"%%item_tags%%, %%item_read_more_button%%, %%item_show_image%%, "
"%%item_image_URL %%, %%item_description%%, %%item_gallery%%, "
"%%item_pub_date%%, %%downloaded_file%%. Если вы определили имена "
"пользовательских тегов в поле настроек \"Имена пользовательских тегов "
